+## Domain and source
+
+Use the full native Gauss dictionary and U=0 endpoint proved in the linked canonical endpoint parent, not the low-charge U1 dictionary. Coordinates r=(r0,r1,r2) label a rectangular torus with even extents La>=4, ordered lexicographically. Every positive-axis edge is an unordered edge in the native Hamiltonian with its generator canonically oriented from smaller to larger index. Set t=g lambda, with a common real lambda. We assume t!=0 except in the explicitly trivial limit. The supplied link-X representative is
